        <mxCell id="v_illustrative_footnote" value="Illustrative example: &amp;nbsp; π = 0.5, &amp;nbsp; &lt;i&gt;r&lt;/i&gt; = 0.75, &amp;nbsp; &lt;i&gt;S&lt;/i&gt; = 1, &amp;nbsp; &lt;i&gt;A&lt;/i&gt; = 1. &amp;nbsp; | &amp;nbsp; Before revealing &lt;i&gt;A&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;q&lt;/i&gt;&lt;sup&gt;*&lt;/sup&gt; = 0.75. &amp;nbsp; | &amp;nbsp; Copy: 0.75 → 0.75. &amp;nbsp; Independent: 0.75 → 0.90." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#374854;overflow=visible;resizable=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
